<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6409942330405564520..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Killing of Derek Hale: Death by Police PR Stunt?</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>14</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5819544302307418651</id><published>2011-11-08T18:47:30.617-07:00</published><updated>2011-11-08T18:47:30.617-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As a former Marine, Law Enforcement officer and bi...</title><content type='html'>As a former Marine, Law Enforcement officer and biker, this story is so very sad. I cannot understand why they shot him. The use of the Taser is justified in some instances but I fail to see why he needed to be Tasered while throwing up in the flower bed. How dangerous was he as he laied in the flower bed? Shot him 3 times in the chest? Why? Why was this man, an &amp;quot;alleged gang member&amp;quot; or not treated like an animal? News Flash America, the cops are supposed to be &amp;quot;Public Servants&amp;quot; which means they serve us. When we as a people begin to fear our own law enforcement we&amp;#39;re in trouble.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/5819544302307418651'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/5819544302307418651'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1320803250617#c5819544302307418651' title=''/><author><name>Joker</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07243300900999590361</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1074143813"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 8, 2011 at 6:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4570978677964782088</id><published>2011-11-08T18:41:59.998-07:00</published><updated>2011-11-08T18:41:59.998-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As a former Marine, law enforcement officer and Ha...</title><content type='html'>As a former Marine, law enforcement officer and Harley rider I am saddened by this story. To be tazed 3 times and then shot like an animal is inexcusable. With that many officers around him why did they have to shoot him and not just use &amp;quot;the swarm&amp;quot; tecnique?It is no wonder the trust for law enforcement has become more fear than respect. When citizens begin fearing &amp;quot;thier&amp;quot; law enforcement officials this country is in trouble.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/4570978677964782088'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/4570978677964782088'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1320802919998#c4570978677964782088' title=''/><author><name>Joker</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07243300900999590361</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1074143813"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 8, 2011 at 6:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1087926835015189038</id><published>2009-05-02T16:40:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2009-05-02T16:40:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Some good comments.  But come on, do we really thi...</title><content type='html'>Some good comments.  But come on, do we really think this experience is rare?  It actually happens every day.. but there is rarely any media attention, especially when it&#39;s a minority.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&#39;m pretty surprised the cops didn&#39;t shoot the kids and his wife and the witnesses too.  Looks like this event wasn&#39;t so bad compared to most.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The cop got off &quot;innocent&quot; according to Vice Gangleader President Joe Biden&#39;s son Beau Biden.  One big happy Crime Family.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Haha, why even attempt to go after the cops?  It should be known in America, as it is in 3rd world countries that America has been for decades now; that the only true terrorists are the ones funded and empowered by The Almighty State.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You&#39;re more likely to be arrested for a non-violent crime or assulted by police than robbed working in a convenience store at 3am.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/1087926835015189038'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/1087926835015189038'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1241304000000#c1087926835015189038' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 2, 2009 at 4:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7263707857658007289</id><published>2008-08-16T14:38:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-16T14:38:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I have read every story on the net and this one ha...</title><content type='html'>I have read every story on the net and this one has left me sick to my stomach. I also am concerned that alot of talk about investigation is mentioned but no talk of the FBI. This must be taken to the Federal level. Also Federal lawsuits have no $$ limits and a three year statute. Money is a form of punishment. My son was tasered by these same sadistic type people and I contacted the FBI the next day. After a 14 Month investigation that led to mulitple coruption findings, two Deputies were arrested 07-31-08 and are facing three charges that carry up to a 30 year prison sentence and a $500,000 fine. Beware that all Policeman are always right. The bad ones number high and the good ones will not &quot;RAT&quot; on them so that makes it dangerous for innocent people everywhere. One of the charges for the two animals that tasered my son... Conspiracy to avoid Federal prosecution, a 5 year sentence. Let&#39;s stop this madness by putting them in jail and depleating the funds from the towns who hire these criminals. &lt;BR/&gt;Big Jim   jdeinc@yahoo.com</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/7263707857658007289'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/7263707857658007289'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1218919080000#c7263707857658007289' title=''/><author><name>Big Jim</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03242785307339861391</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-487492956"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 16, 2008 at 2:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3181328754327422420</id><published>2008-06-10T14:18:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-06-10T14:18:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>SUPPORT 81 ONE LESS PAGAN!!!</title><content type='html'>SUPPORT 81 ONE LESS PAGAN!!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/3181328754327422420'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/3181328754327422420'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1213129080000#c3181328754327422420' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2008 at 2:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-807979507099412401</id><published>2008-01-31T13:26:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-31T13:26:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Oh, my.Here&#39;s the lawsuit.Here&#39;s what I&#39;m dealing ...</title><content type='html'>Oh, my.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.rutherford.org/pdf/hale_complaint.pdf&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s the lawsuit.&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Here&#39;s &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://christopher-king.blogspot.com/2008/01/kingcast-open-letter-to-nh-state-house.html&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;what I&#39;m dealing with in New Hampshire over a bad cop.&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The bill failed. Still waiting on the DVD of him OC Spraying another victim and still waiting a decision from the Court on my Right to Know litigation, &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.youtube.com/profile_videos?user=Franconia511&amp;p=r&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;you can listen to it here&lt;/A&gt; and video is coming.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I&#39;m a former AAG who has practiced Civil Rights Law; don&#39;t care for injustice. Not too much, anyway.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Nice blog.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Namaste.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/807979507099412401'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/807979507099412401'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1201811160000#c807979507099412401' title=''/><author><name>Christopher King</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14366216769773124756</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://i32.photobucket.com/albums/d44/blackenroe/ServeitupKing.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-751586684"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 31, 2008 at 1:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4552406473334468955</id><published>2007-11-23T18:31:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-23T18:31:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thank you for posting this. I am using the Derek H...</title><content type='html'>Thank you for posting this. I am using the Derek Hale incident to warn others of their dramatic loss of rights to person and property, and found your detailed post. I will send something to his next-of-kin. A comment about someone else&#39;s comment regarding dangers to Elaine Hale and her children: one way to reduce the risk of (further) attack is to make sure that the government agencies involved  know that someone cares about the potential victim...a &quot;heartbeat protocol&quot; whereby everyone in the group keeps track of everyone else, and goes after anyone who attacks someone in the group. It&#39;s not much but it&#39;s better than trying to defend yourself as an isolated individual against an out-of-control state.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/4552406473334468955'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/4552406473334468955'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1195867860000#c4552406473334468955' title=''/><author><name>Atash</name><uri>http://mutuallyassuredsurvival.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 23, 2007 at 6:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3938080304157233066</id><published>2007-10-28T18:55:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-28T18:55:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>These officers need some sort of accountability. I...</title><content type='html'>These officers need some sort of accountability. It is my sincere hope that at some point we have police officers being forced to pay a type of insurance payment as we have our medical professionals in the form of malpractice. &lt;BR/&gt;#1. If they make a mistake, the citizens of the jurisdiction are not forced to pay for the mistakes of the offender.&lt;BR/&gt;#2. If an officer has too many infractions, his rates could be charged in accordance with his offenses.&lt;BR/&gt;#3. If an officer moves from one jurisdiction to another, his past records cannot be lost or misplaced.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/3938080304157233066'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/3938080304157233066'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1193619300000#c3938080304157233066' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 28, 2007 at 6:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-638815706180922224</id><published>2007-04-15T08:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-15T08:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I am also a subsciber to TNA.I found this blog to ...</title><content type='html'>I am also a subsciber to TNA.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I found this blog to be interesting and revealing as it relates to JBS.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://jbsrip.blogspot.com/&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;It seems that Richard Viguerie is doing a better job in the fight for freedom than the JBS leadership.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/638815706180922224'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/638815706180922224'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176647340000#c638815706180922224' title=''/><author><name>TNA subscriber</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 15, 2007 at 8:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8966384864938701389</id><published>2007-04-14T17:02:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-14T17:02:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>As a Christian libertarian and a long-time reader ...</title><content type='html'>As a Christian libertarian and a long-time reader of TNA, I was thrilled to find your blog. Thanks for bringing attention to this case. I&#39;ll definitely be around again.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/8966384864938701389'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/8966384864938701389'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176591720000#c8966384864938701389' title=''/><author><name>Patrick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03122230289375277232</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1876405975"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 14, 2007 at 5:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5920612483017882389</id><published>2007-04-13T20:01:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-13T20:01:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hopefully Officer Browne will be found guilty of m...</title><content type='html'>Hopefully Officer Browne will be found guilty of manslaughter. Locked within the confines of the Deleware State Pen., surrounded by many of those he arrested, will give him plenty of time to think about his reprehensible actions.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/5920612483017882389'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/5920612483017882389'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176516060000#c5920612483017882389' title=''/><author><name>nhforester</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02698821494245403337</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-266305293"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 13, 2007 at 8:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6457822848499193684</id><published>2007-04-13T19:30:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-13T19:30:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The officers involved, all of them, deserve to han...</title><content type='html'>The officers involved, all of them, deserve to hang for this. They shed innocent blood on purpose, so by rights their blood should be shed.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/6457822848499193684'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/6457822848499193684'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176514200000#c6457822848499193684' title=''/><author><name>MikeT</name><uri>http://www.codemonkeyramblings.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 13, 2007 at 7:30 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-549028581375230112</id><published>2007-04-13T17:09:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-13T17:09:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I do hope that Derek&#39;s surviving family members an...</title><content type='html'>I do hope that Derek&#39;s surviving family members and friends (especially those present at the scene of the murder) are exercising &lt;B&gt;&lt;I&gt;extreme&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/B&gt; caution and taking extra measures to guarantee their safety.  Because this high-profile lawsuit will very likely result in some ugly consequences for agents of the State, it is no paranoid exaggeration to believe that law enforcement elements in Delaware and Virginia will go out of their way to make life for Elaine Hale and her children as uncomfortable as possible.  If cops can behave as violently and recklessly as they did at the time of Derek Hale&#39;s murder when they had the upper hand in the situation, it stands to reason that they would behave like cornered wild animals when threatened with accountability and/or punishment.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/549028581375230112'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/549028581375230112'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176505740000#c549028581375230112' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17513085996737382530</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-639819241"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 13, 2007 at 5:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2415211233003519672</id><published>2007-04-13T14:40:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-13T14:40:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I came across your site quite by happenstance.  It...</title><content type='html'>I came across your site quite by happenstance.  It&#39;s nice to see other Christian libertarians out here. I&#39;m bookmarking you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/2415211233003519672'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6409942330405564520/comments/default/2415211233003519672'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html?showComment=1176496800000#c2415211233003519672' title=''/><author><name>Al</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01163309300494260705</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/killing-of-derek-hale-death-by-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6409942330405564520' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6409942330405564520' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-624507119"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 13, 2007 at 2:40 PM"/></entry></feed>